    "_comment": "vk.ic.len() must equal number_of_public_signals + 1. verify_groth16 in lib.rs returns false when public_inputs.len() + 1 != vk.ic.len(). This rule needs no verification key; one is produced by the trusted setup, which is a separate step.",
